{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117931c42d9aee0a3225da969cd0b4bc4dc028ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^2-3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b81ecef70f0a49c9bf7a97ee110cf288515906.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=2x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/40879ba4944fc189ca98e15de587f1eef1071437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(g(3))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cd57b477f75e13d103c917e37e646898a374eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  -3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  12 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"425\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d405bc698521b017accfb37dae5a7e162f623da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(3) = 2 \\times 3 - 1 = 6 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78c0314527020eb1ae2d41c81615d8d08cb24f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(3) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16c1bbd001e27efba4dbdfddbd7de4c7514b9ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(g(3)) = f(5) = 5^{2} - 3 \\times 5 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a30d6b02b3fa92cb9ff9c23a7c341c55aa7c5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 - 15 + 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan